@baseUrl = https://localhost:7248
@habitId = 82e6294b-2046-420e-a4c8-b160c4a07cdc
### Iegūt ieradumu sarakstu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/habits
Accept: application/json

### Izveidot ieradumu
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Read a book",
  "description": "Read for 20 minutes",
  "schedule": {
    "isDaily": true,
    "days": []
  }
}

### Labot ieradumu un izvēlēties pirmdienu, trešdienu, piektdienu
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Read a book",
  "description": "Read for 30 minutes",
  "schedule": {
    "isDaily": false,
    "days": [1, 3, 5]
  }
}

### Atzīmēt izpildi konkrētajā datumā
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-04"
}

### Apskatīt izpildes ierakstus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/completions
Accept: application/json

### Apskatīt laboto ieradumu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Accept: application/json

### Arhivēt ieradumu
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/archive

### Mēģināt atzīmēt arhivētu ieradumu
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-05"
}

### Atjaunot ieradumu no arhīva
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/archive

### Mēģināt izveidot ieradumu ar tukšu nosaukumu
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "description": "Kļūdas pārbaude",
  "schedule": {
    "isDaily": true,
    "days": []
  }
}

### Pieprasīt neesošu ieradumu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/habits/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000